# `nix build` output. Tracked once by accident, which made every lane's tree
# dirty the moment anyone built the flake — and `scruff reap` refuses to reap a
# checkout with uncommitted work in it, so lanes piled up until someone
# deleted files by hand. Same reasoning as the *.profraw rule in AGENTS.md:
# a build artifact showing up in `git status` is the signal, not the noise.
result
result-*
